{
    "title": "Baby Language",
    "description": "\ud83d\udc76 <b>TRY BEFORE YOU BUY</b> \ud83d\udc76\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc76<b>Manual for babies younger than 6 months </b>\r\nDiscover why your baby is crying and learn to master this skill yourself.\r\n\r\nSupported languages: English, Espa\u00f1ol, Nederlands, Italiano, Deutsch, Fran\u00e7ais, P\u0443\u0441\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0439, Portugu\u00eas do Brasil, bahasa Indonesia, \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e, \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629\r\n \r\n\ud83d\udc76 <b>TRY BEFORE YOU BUY</b>\r\nThis app has a free trial system were you get the opportunity to see that it\u2019s not a scam and to decide if this app works for you.\r\nThe try/trial version consists of fully operational (but time-limited) cry recognition system, and a small selection of tips, tricks and teaching materials.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc76<b>MAIN FEATURES</b>\r\n\u2b50 Real-time cry recognition and distinguish tool\r\n\u2b50 Many illustrations how to handle each cry\r\n\u2b50 Instructions how to distinguish cries yourself\r\n\u2b50 Lots of tips and tricks to prevent or reduce each specific cry\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc76<b>PROLOGUE</b>\r\nThe Baby Language app has a tool that recognizes and translates your baby cries into understandable language, and it teaches you how to master this skill yourself. The app also gives you many ways how to handle each specific cry, and finally the app contains lots of tips and tricks to prevent or reduce any specific baby cry.\r\n\r\n\u2b50This app has everything you need to understand your baby much better in the first few months.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc76<b>BETTER APPROACH</b>\r\nThe build-in recognition system is much more accurate and helpful then other tools because we use a very different approach. We are not recording audio and sending it into a black box that will magically give you a single inexplicable answer. Our system instantly shows every detected cry or chatter in five value bars that are filled as more characteristics of a specific cry is detected. Finally, all characteristics of a specific cry are explained in detail so you can learn the skill yourself, from the sound originating source to the vocal and visual points to watch for.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc76<b>CRY RECOGNITION SYSTEM</b>\r\nThe built-in recognition system has been trained with hundreds of sound samples. We are currently working to train the system with more than a thousand sound samples to further improve recognition.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc76<b>REALTIME / NO INTERNET</b>\r\nBaby cry recognition is done without an internet connection, and done real-time with instant feedback, so no need to record 30 seconds of sound or to wait multiple seconds for any calculation.\r\n\r\nAttention! \r\n- internet connection is only used for crash and error reporting\r\n- (optional) camera usage is only used for coupon system",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83d\udc76 <b>TRY BEFORE YOU BUY</b> \ud83d\udc76<br><br>\ud83d\udc76<b>Manual for babies younger than 6 months </b><br>Discover why your baby is crying and learn to master this skill yourself.<br><br>Supported languages: English, Espa\u00f1ol, Nederlands, Italiano, Deutsch, Fran\u00e7ais, P\u0443\u0441\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0439, Portugu\u00eas do Brasil, bahasa Indonesia, \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e, \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629<br> <br>\ud83d\udc76 <b>TRY BEFORE YOU BUY</b><br>This app has a free trial system were you get the opportunity to see that it\u2019s not a scam and to decide if this app works for you.<br>The try/trial version consists of fully operational (but time-limited) cry recognition system, and a small selection of tips, tricks and teaching materials.<br><br>\ud83d\udc76<b>MAIN FEATURES</b><br>\u2b50 Real-time cry recognition and distinguish tool<br>\u2b50 Many illustrations how to handle each cry<br>\u2b50 Instructions how to distinguish cries yourself<br>\u2b50 Lots of tips and tricks to prevent or reduce each specific cry<br><br>\ud83d\udc76<b>PROLOGUE</b><br>The Baby Language app has a tool that recognizes and translates your baby cries into understandable language, and it teaches you how to master this skill yourself. The app also gives you many ways how to handle each specific cry, and finally the app contains lots of tips and tricks to prevent or reduce any specific baby cry.<br><br>\u2b50This app has everything you need to understand your baby much better in the first few months.<br><br>\ud83d\udc76<b>BETTER APPROACH</b><br>The build-in recognition system is much more accurate and helpful then other tools because we use a very different approach. We are not recording audio and sending it into a black box that will magically give you a single inexplicable answer. Our system instantly shows every detected cry or chatter in five value bars that are filled as more characteristics of a specific cry is detected. Finally, all characteristics of a specific cry are explained in detail so you can learn the skill yourself, from the sound originating source to the vocal and visual points to watch for.<br><br>\ud83d\udc76<b>CRY RECOGNITION SYSTEM</b><br>The built-in recognition system has been trained with hundreds of sound samples. We are currently working to train the system with more than a thousand sound samples to further improve recognition.<br><br>\ud83d\udc76<b>REALTIME / NO INTERNET</b><br>Baby cry recognition is done without an internet connection, and done real-time with instant feedback, so no need to record 30 seconds of sound or to wait multiple seconds for any calculation.<br><br>Attention! <br>- internet connection is only used for crash and error reporting<br>- (optional) camera usage is only used for coupon system",
